d_at":null},"comments":0,"created_at":"2026-09-24T10:08:36Z","updated_at":"2026-09-24T10:42:45Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123792","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123792","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123792.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123792.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\nCloses #120051\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nInstead of accumulating the playback position in the worklet, it's actually easier to accumulate the position in the SampleNode itself. SampleNode knows the current pitch scale as frames are processed, so this accumulation is easier to accommodate here - we don't have to ship position/pitch scales back and forth.\r\n\r\nVerified with the MRP in #120051 that all ranges of pitch_scale properly accumulate position:\r\n\r\n<img width=\"848\" height=\"736\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/144b5004-da3a-4f5b-b5b3-0a8ba77f41df\" />\r\n\r\nSeparately: This worklet is likely generating a lot of messages and could be modified to only emit messages after a certain number of rendering quantums. That seems out of scope for this fix, but would be happy to handle that if desired.\r\n\r\n(no AI)","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123792/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":1,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123792/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}